WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.740
On an empty canvas, Add, then Docker Image: nginx:1.27 is staged and deployed. The wait is sped up and labelled.

2
00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:10.140
Add Postgres. It runs as its own service with a volume.

3
00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:16.540
Set DATABASE_URL on nginx to ${{Postgres.DATABASE_URL}}, then redeploy.

4
00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:21.740
In Settings, Networking, Generate Domain gives nginx a public HTTPS name.

5
00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:24.140
Open the name: the nginx welcome page, served over HTTPS.
